    description: "Full-suite runs 6118, 6131, 6149: 'FAIL: 1 callable(s) are newly reachable only from their own tests: + gitleaks.py::scan_content'. a473cd2bba (11-06) switched scan_content_cached to the new _scan, leaving scan_content called only by test_gitleaks.py (grep of packages/*/src and scripts: no caller). Its contract returns [] both for clean and for not-scanned, the ambiguity that a473cd2bba and WI-rapuh removed elsewhere. The ratchet says to wire it to production or retire it and forbids raising the baseline. Likely fix: retire it and move its tests to _scan / scan_content_cached. Consequence: the full-suite cron is red on self-tree-validation every run (together with WI-tikon's id_format pair)."  # 0bdc
    fields: {}  # 0bdc
